BT /F2 13.0 Tf 0.060 0.130 0.250 rg 48.00 375.30 Td (Attack Path Visualization) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 357.30 Td (The risk is not that the model is malicious by itself. The risk is that untrusted prompt or retrieved) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 343.80 Td (context can steer a network-capable tool unless deterministic URL policy checks happen outside the model.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 324.30 Td (1. Prompt Influence: Untrusted content influences the agent planner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.360 0.390 0.450 rg 48.00 309.10 Td (Control gap: The prompt is treated as trusted instruction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.050 0.460 0.430 rg 48.00 294.30 Td (Defensive breakpoint: Classify external prompt and retrieved content as untrusted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 277.50 Td (2. Tool Selection: The planner selects the web fetch tool with a model-controlled destination.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.360 0.390 0.450 rg 48.00 262.30 Td (Control gap: Tool parameters rely on model judgment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.050 0.460 0.430 rg 48.00 247.50 Td (Defensive breakpoint: Validate tool parameters before execution.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 230.70 Td (3. Network Boundary: The runtime attempts outbound access from a trusted network position.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.360 0.390 0.450 rg 48.00 215.50 Td (Control gap: No allowlist or private IP block after DNS resolution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.050 0.460 0.430 rg 48.00 200.70 Td (Defensive breakpoint: Block private, reserved, and link-local ranges.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 183.90 Td (4. Impact: Internal services or metadata endpoints may become reachable through the agent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.360 0.390 0.450 rg 48.00 168.70 Td (Control gap: Runtime egress is too broad.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.050 0.460 0.430 rg 48.00 153.90 Td (Defensive breakpoint: Restrict egress and require approval for new domains.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 137.10 Td (5. Detect / Break: Denied URL attempts should be logged and covered by regression tests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.360 0.390 0.450 rg 48.00 121.90 Td (Control gap: No test proves the unsafe request is blocked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.050 0.460 0.430 rg 48.00 107.10 Td (Defensive breakpoint: Add CI tests and runtime detections for blocked destinations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 90.30 Td (Attacker goal: Cause the agent runtime to request an internal or otherwise unauthorized URL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.070 0.090 0.150 rg 48.00 74.50 Td (Preconditions: The attacker can influence prompt, chat, document, or workflow context that reaches the agent planner.) Tj ET
